sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set-for rx quiet.start 00:00
set-for rx quiet.end 01:00
send e1 alice rx ttl=30m expires before quiet ends
send e2 alice rx ttl=1h lives exactly to the end
send e3 alice rx ttl=2h delivered later
advance 2h
stats
